<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18979" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάδην</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>step by step,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἀπιόντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.516
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄραχνος ὡς β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					887
				</span></i>
			; <i>in marching step,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦγε β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.57
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡγοῦ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					254
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ταχὺ ἐφέπεσθαι</span>
			<i>at quick march,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρόμῳ θεῖν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.6.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾶττον ἢ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.4.53
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				837
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				2.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ὑποχωρεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					629b14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>gradually, more and more,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεινῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					535
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>on foot,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ ἵππων, ἐπὶ
				ναῶν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				19
			</span></i> (anap.); opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀπήνης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Gall.</u>
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
